## Notes

The adoption stage controls KAS planner/implementer lane selection. Stage 1
records direct Codex app-server evidence and no-KAB-Codex rationale; Stage 2
uses KAB Codex-first through `native_codex`; Stage 3 enables KAB backend
selection after project policy and capability gates. Official GLM Octo review is
independent of this implementation-stage setting.

